'''Lok Lambert''' is the son of legendary [[Seeker]], [[Eathon Lambert]], whose chance discovery of his father's [[Eathon Lambert's journal|journal]] changed his life forever. Thrown into the magical world of [[Seekers]] and [[Titans]], Lok gained the help of his classmate, [[Sophie Casterwill]], and [[Dante Vale]], the master Seeker who would become his friend and mentor. Together, they embarked on a quest to find the ancient [[Amulet of Will]] before the evil [[Organization]], and uncover the truth behind his father's disappearance. He may not be book smart, but Lok's enthusiasm, intuition and knack for solving puzzles let him find answers where others can't, and his courage to persevere no matter the odds has seen him rise from a rookie to become one of the most powerful Seekers in the [[Huntik Foundation]]. 

== Appearance ==
Lok is a boy with blond hair and blue eyes. His usual attire includes an unbuttoned white shirt over a long navy undershirt, a pair of brown bracelets, blue cargo jeans with a loose brown belt, and gray sneakers with red highlights. {{source|A Seeker Is Born}} Occasionally, he also wears a two-toned brown jacket. {{source|Chasing Void}} For some desert missions, he wears a two-pocketed white shirt tucked into a pair of khaki cargo shorts. {{source|The Golden Asp}}

